@startuml
' NewEra POS - State diagram of a refund (UC2 and UC5 step 9, card refund), W11
' Team D - editable source of assets/state_card_refund.png
' Render with: java -jar plantuml.jar -tpng -charset UTF-8 assets/state_card_refund.puml
' Sources: SRS UC2 and UC5 ext. 9a to 9c, FR-25, FR-26, FR-55, FR-77, BR-08, AD-07, system_interfaces.md 3.7, data model (refund_status).
' The states in capitals are the values of refund_status.status and of the "refund" field of the system API.

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam StateBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #EAF1FB
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B8A04A
skinparam StateStartColor #444444
skinparam StateEndColor #444444

title NewEra POS - State diagram: refund of a return or a rental return

state "Choosing the tender\n(of the original transaction)" as Choose
state "Sending the card refund" as Sending
state "Asking the refund status\n(same transaction ID)" as Asking
state "PENDING" as Pending
state "NEEDS_APPROVAL" as Needs
state "CARD_REFUNDED" as Card
state "CASH_PAID" as Cash
state "Discarded" as Discarded

[*] --> Choose : confirmReturn() or confirmRentalReturn()\n(UC2 step 9, UC5 step 9)
Choose --> Cash : paid in cash (UC2 ext. 9a):\nthe drawer opens (IR-14)
Choose --> Sending : paid by credit card (ext. 9b)
Choose --> Needs : paid by check (ext. 9c, Could)

Sending --> Card : refund APPROVED:\nreference recorded (9b)
Sending --> Needs : refund DECLINED (9b2a)
Sending --> Asking : no answer within 10 s (9b2b)
Asking --> Card : status APPROVED
Asking --> Needs : status DECLINED:\nrefund failed or unknown
Asking --> Pending : still no answer:\nnothing is paid (9b2b step 4)

Pending --> Asking : checkRefundStatus()\n(the cashier asks again, FR-77)
Needs --> Cash : approveCashRefund(managerID, pin, reason)\nthe manager and the reason are recorded (FR-25)
Needs --> Discarded : the manager does not approve,\nreturn not yet saved (ext. 8a)

Card --> [*]
Cash --> [*]
Discarded --> [*]

note right of Pending
  The return or rental return is already saved and complete:
  the item is back, the refund waits. No cash is paid until
  the refund is known to have failed (FR-26, FR-55).
  The refund is in the list of pending refunds (FR-77).
end note

note bottom of Needs
  A saved return whose pending refund turns out to have failed
  stays in NEEDS_APPROVAL until a store manager approves it
  from the pending refund mode of S-07 or S-09.
end note

note bottom of Card
  Each change of state is a new row of refund_status (data model v0.2):
  the row of the refund itself never changes (DR-04).
  The refund is never paid twice (the same transaction ID, AD-07).
end note
@enduml
